{"id":"2ca84a186d953c49","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-column-extraction.md","title":"可数 join 的列提取","display":"df-column-extraction — 可数 join 的列提取","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-column-extraction","aliases":["20-df-column-extraction"],"display":"df-column-extraction — 可数 join 的列提取","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 6.5.6；本笔记配对方向的显式转换","source_printed_pages":[142],"source_pdf_pages":[176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-column-extraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-column-extraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-column-extraction — 可数 join 的列提取"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.5.6；本笔记配对方向的显式转换"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}column\\text{-}extraction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Col}(X,i):=\\{x:\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in X\\},\\\\\nX_{&lt;n}:=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in X:i&lt;n\\},\\qquad\nX=\\bigoplus_i\\operatorname{Col}(X,i).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}column\\text{-}extraction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Col}(X,i):=\\{x:\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in X\\},\\\\\nX_{&lt;n}:=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in X:i&lt;n\\},\\qquad\nX=\\bigoplus_i\\operatorname{Col}(X,i).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §6.5 按第二坐标作为列号，本笔记上游可数 join 按第一坐标作为列号；此处固定提取方向。坐标交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,x\\rangle\\mapsto\\langle x,i\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,x\\rangle\\mapsto\\langle x,i\\rangle\\)</span> 是可计算置换，因此保留原书度论性质。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Col}\">\\(\\operatorname{Col}\\)</span> 去掉列标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{&lt;n}\">\\(X_{&lt;n}\\)</span> 则保留原编码；这两种对象不可混写。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.5.6；本笔记配对方向的显式转换；印刷页 142；PDF 第 176 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}column\\text{-}extraction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Col}(X,i):=\\{x:\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in X\\},\\\\\nX_{<n}:=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in X:i<n\\},\\qquad\nX=\\bigoplus_i\\operatorname{Col}(X,i).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle i,x\\rangle\\mapsto\\langle x,i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Col}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{<n}","display":false}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"b726984ad897f45b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-column-extraction]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。"},{"id":"22bad1b580e74bd2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-column-extraction]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"}],"outgoing":["35073b74f84433b3","08b4fd5163a7f955"]}